{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-momentum","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:q-momentum","kind":"definition","title":"$q$-Momentum from the braid writhe","tags":["momentum","q-deformed","writhe","braid","hecke","crossing","kinematic"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum","text":"q-momentum.md","leanSource":"q-momentum.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:q-momentum\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta \\in B_n</code> be the canonical braid representative — the Gröbner–Shirshov normal form at the minimal level of the brane tower — of a particle knot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K = \\hat{\\beta}</code> (braid closure), with generators <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_{i_1}^{\\epsilon_1} \\cdots \\sigma_{i_k}^{\\epsilon_k}</code> where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\epsilon_j = \\pm 1</code>. For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\neq \\pm 1</code>, the <strong><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-momentum</strong> is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  p_q(\\beta) =  \\sum_{j=1}^{k} [\\epsilon_j]_q\n  =  \\sum_{j=1}^{k} \\frac{q^{\\epsilon_j} - q^{-\\epsilon_j}}{q - q^{-1}},</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[\\epsilon]_q = (q^{\\epsilon} - q^{-\\epsilon})/(q - q^{-1})</code> is the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-integer.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.md","heading":"Definition","number":"12.3.2","page":"b/def-q-momentum","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.QMomentum","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
